I'll build this sheet-pan chicken schedule as a Rhylthyme program. Let me start by checking if there's a catalog match, then construct the program if needed.

Since this is a specific, detailed recipe with particular timing constraints (potatoes go in first, chicken 15 min later, broccoli added at 20 min, etc.), it's unlikely to have an exact public match. I'll build the program from the source text.

**Analyzing the workflow:**

- **Oven track**: preheat → prep potatoes → roast potatoes alone → prep chicken → roast chicken+potatoes together → add broccoli → final roast → rest
- **Pan sauce track**: starts after pans come out (at 15+15+20=50 min), reduce → whisk butter
- **Salad track**: starts when chicken goes in (at 15+15=30 min), wash/dry → vinaigrette → dress (timed to 5 min into rest)
- **Plating track**: waits for rest to finish, then plate everything

**Resource constraints:**
- oven: 1
- sheet pans: 2 (but used sequentially in one track for potatoes then chicken)
- burner: 1 (for pan sauce)
- prep: 1 cook (multiple prep tasks)

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "sheet-pan-chicken",
  "name": "Sheet-Pan Chicken with Potatoes and Broccoli",
  "description": "Tuesday dinner for four. Oven-roasted chicken thighs, potatoes, and broccoli with pan sauce and fresh salad.",
  "environmentType": "kitchen",
  "actors": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "oven",
      "name": "Oven & sheet pans",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "preheat",
          "name": "Preheat oven to 425°F",
          "task": "oven",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "prep_potatoes",
          "name": "Toss potatoes with oil and salt",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 480 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "preheat" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "roast_potatoes_alone",
          "name": "Roast potatoes (15 min alone)",
          "task": "oven",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "prep_potatoes" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "prep_chicken",
          "name": "Pat chicken dry, rub with spices, lay on pan",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "roast_potatoes_alone" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "roast_both",
          "name": "Roast chicken & potatoes together (20 min)",
          "task": "oven",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "prep_chicken" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "add_broccoli",
          "name": "Rotate pans, add broccoli to potato pan",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 240 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "roast_both" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "roast_final",
          "name": "Final roast with broccoli (15 min)",
          "task": "oven",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "add_broccoli" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "rest_chicken",
          "name": "Rest chicken on board",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 480 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "roast_final" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "sauce",
      "name": "Pan sauce",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "make_sauce",
          "name": "Tip pan juices into pan, add stock and mustard, reduce",
          "task": "burner",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 360 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "roast_final" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "finish_sauce",
          "name": "Whisk in cold butter off heat",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "make_sauce" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "hold_sauce",
          "name": "Keep sauce ready (off heat)",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "indefinite", "defaultSeconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "finish_sauce" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "salad",
      "name": "Salad",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "wash_salad",
          "name": "Wash and dry salad leaves",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 360 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "roast_potatoes_alone" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "make_vinaigrette",
          "name": "Shake vinaigrette in jar",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "wash_salad" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "dress_salad",
          "name": "Dress salad (after 5 min of chicken rest)",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "rest_chicken", "offsetSeconds": 300 }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "plate",
      "name": "Plating",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "plate",
          "name": "Slice thighs and plate everything",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 360 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "rest_chicken" }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "oven", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "burner", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "prep", "maxConcurrent": 1 }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "serves": "4",
    "ingredients": [
      { "name": "chicken thighs", "measure": "4 large" },
      { "name": "potatoes", "measure": "1.5 lbs" },
      { "name": "broccoli", "measure": "1 head" },
      { "name": "olive oil", "measure": "3 tbsp" },
      { "name": "spice mix", "measure": "to taste" },
      { "name": "stock", "measure": "½ cup" },
      { "name": "mustard", "measure": "1 tbsp" },
      { "name": "cold butter", "measure": "2 tbsp" },
      { "name": "salad leaves", "measure": "4 cups" },
      { "name": "vinaigrette", "measure": "to taste" }
    ]
  }
}
```

This program reflects:
- **Sequential oven use**: preheat → potatoes alone → both → final with broccoli
- **Offset salad start**: begins when chicken goes in (after roast_potatoes_alone)
- **Pan sauce timing**: starts after final roast comes out
- **Dress-salad delay**: anchored 5 minutes into the rest, so it's fresh for plating
- **Single cook**: all prep tasks share one `prep` constraint
- **Makespan**: ~52 min total (preheat 15 + potatoes 8 + roast alone 15 + chicken prep 10 + both 20 + add broccoli 4 + final 15 + rest 8)

The schedule honors the source text's constraint that salad is dressed only after the chicken has been resting for 5 minutes, and sauce waits until the pans come out.
